1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
And now, the old scout master.

2
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:15,120
Young scout, tenderfoot scout, signs on to the troop website for the first time and he's

3
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,440
prompted to create a password.

4
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:21,440
He reads the password instructions and this is the password that he comes up with.

5
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,440
You ready?

6
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:29,520
Mickey Minnie, Pluto, Huey, Dewey, Louie, Donald Goofy, Harrisburg.

7
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:33,680
That's a long password, but it sounds right to me because the instructions said, you know,

8
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:38,840
to make a secure password, you need at least eight characters and it needs to include at

9
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:39,840
least one capital.

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,840
All right.

11
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:41,840
All right.

12
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:42,840
I can hear you out there.

13
