00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,840
Hey!

22
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:58,840
Hey, this is the podcast number 82.

23
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,840
Hey!

24
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:04,840
Hey!

25
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:07,840
Hey!

26
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,840
Hey!

27
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:12,840
Hey!

28
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:15,840
Hey!

29
